  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "The theme and density buttons at the top of every page switch between light and dark and between\ncomfortable and compact rows. Like the language, they follow your account to every browser."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "Before a session ends for inactivity, a warning offers to keep you signed in."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "depth": 2,
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "Check your sign-ins"
    }
   ],
   "data": {
    "id": "check-your-sign-ins"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "Sessions lists your active sign-ins at this entrance. Admin and Portal have separate lists.\nEach entry shows its sign-in method, sign-in time, last activity and expiry as returned by\nthe server. It does not identify a device or location. "
    },
    {
     "type": "strong",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "value": "Current session"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": " identifies the\nsign-in making this request; use "
    },
    {
     "type": "strong",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "value": "Sign out"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": " in the account menu to leave it."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "Use "
    },
    {
     "type": "strong",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "value": "Refresh"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": " to check the first page and "
    },
    {
     "type": "strong",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "value": "Load more sessions"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": " to continue. The list\ndoes not refresh in the background. A partial failure keeps earlier pages; an expired\ncursor offers to restart from the first page. A permission refusal hides earlier entries."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "To end another sign-in, choose "
    },
    {
     "type": "strong",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "value": "End session"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": " and type its session ID. This immediately\nends its access and cannot be undone. A confirmed end reads the list again. If the result\nis uncertain, choose "
    },
    {
     "type": "strong",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "value": "Read again"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": " before another explicit attempt. A missing entry or\nnot-found reply alone does not prove the end succeeded. The page never automatically\nreplays an end request. When a retry delay is shown, wait until it ends before retrying."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "Changing your password replaces this browser's session and ends all your other sessions.\nThe Sessions section starts a new read rather than reusing the previous current marker."
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
